WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:11.100
Workers guide a concrete base hanging from crane slings across a foundation slab, walking beside it with their hands on it.

00:11.100 --> 00:13.900
A close view: two workers lean into the block with gloved hands as it comes down.

00:13.900 --> 00:16.900
A worker crouched beside the block presses a gloved hand against its side.

00:16.900 --> 00:21.800
Two workers crouch against the block, pressing it with their hands to seat it on its guide hardware.
